Package: sluice
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Sluice <https://github.com/ZaidX88/sluice/issues>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @LIBC@, dotnet-runtime-10.0, nftables, libcap2-bin, libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1, libnotify-bin
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ZaidX88/sluice
Description: rule-based traffic router: each app direct, blocked or through a tunnel
 Sluice sends each app's connections where you choose: directly, blocked, or
 through a tunnel (SSH, SOCKS, HTTP(S), VLESS, VMess, Trojan, Shadowsocks,
 Hysteria2, TUIC). Rules go by application or by site.
 .
 It includes sing-box @SINGBOX_VERSION@ (GPL-3.0-or-later), the helper for the
 encrypted tunnels.
